│ ┃  Patch to resolve get_FIELD_display override issue in Django   ┃ │
│ ┃                              2.2+                              ┃ │
│ ┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛ │
│                                                                    │
│ The issue arises because Django 2.2+ uses the display() method of  │
│ the field in the __str__ method of a model, rather than            │
│ get_FIELD_DISPLAY(). This change breaks the ability to override    │
│ get_FIELD_DISPLAY() in models. The solution is to replace the call │
│ to get_foo_bar_display() with the field's display() method.        │
│                                                                    │
